<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF WOMEN'S GIANT SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-RESULTS OF WOMEN'S GIANT SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official results of</p>
<p>the women's giant slalom at the World Cup Finals on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Deborah Compagnoni (Italy) two minutes, 11:45 seconds</p>
<p>(1:05.98/1:05.47)</p>
<p>  2. Katja Seizinger (Germany)	 2:11.83 (1:05.81/1:05.02)</p>
<p>  3. Karin Roten (Switzerland)	 2:12.07 (1:06.74/1:05.33)</p>
<p>  4. Isolde Kostner (Italy)	    2:12.51 (1:07.25/1:05.26)</p>
<p>  5. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden)	  2:12.55 (1:06.59/1:05.96)</p>
<p>  6. Sophie Lefranc (France	    2:12.71 (1:06.44/1:06.27)</p>
<p>  7. Ana Galindo Santolaria (Spain)  2:12.98 (1:06.57/1:06.41)</p>
<p>  8. Martina Ertl (Germany)	    2:13.06 (1:07.44/1:05.62)</p>
<p>  9. Anita Wachter (Austria)	   2:13.13 (1:06.51/1:06.62)</p>
