<p> 16. Karen Putzer (Italy)		2:13.91 (1:08.05/1:05.86)</p>
<p> 17. Sonja Nef (Switzerland)	   2:14.29 (1:07.74/1:06.55)</p>
<p> 18. Renate Goetschl (Austria)	 2:14.80 (1:08.41/1:06.39)</p>
